<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Idempotence on myCodingsHub</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/tags/idempotence/</link><description>Recent content in Idempotence on myCodingsHub</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en</language><managingEditor>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</managingEditor><webMaster>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 09:30:00 +0900</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://mycodingshub.github.io/tags/idempotence/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Go Concurrency 마스터하기: 경쟁 상태(Race Condition), 뮤텍스 너머의 세계</title><link>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/go-concurrency-complete-guide/08-go-concurrency-race-condition/</link><pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 09:30:00 +0900</pubDate><author>cpro95@gmail.com (myCodingsHub)</author><guid>https://mycodingshub.github.io/guides/go-concurrency-complete-guide/08-go-concurrency-race-condition/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;지난 장에서 배운 뮤텍스(Mutex)로 &lt;strong&gt;데이터 경쟁&lt;/strong&gt;(Data Race)은 막을 수 있습니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;하지만 &lt;strong&gt;경쟁 상태&lt;/strong&gt;(Race Condition)는 차원이 다른 문제입니다.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;데이터 경쟁이 &amp;ldquo;메모리 접근 오류&amp;quot;라면, 경쟁 상태는 &amp;ldquo;논리적 순서 오류&amp;quot;입니다.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>